{"ID":"20260203094626-3i6imtu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f3ab","id":"20260203094626-3i6imtu","title":"Fast R-CNN","type":"doc","updated":"20260227112124"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260203094626-emo8vx5","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260203094626-emo8vx5","updated":"20260227105926"},"CalloutType":"NOTE","CalloutTitle":"Note","CalloutIcon":"✏️","Children":[{"ID":"20260227104935-unx5a51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227104935-unx5a51","updated":"20260227105014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"Fast R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260227104935-9gykahk.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"Fast R-CNN论文"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260227104749-a3l3tbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227104749-a3l3tbu","updated":"20260227105926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Fast R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260203094519-qxx8y9q","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的升级版本，其主要解决的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260203094519-qxx8y9q","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的速度问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20260227105022-gsszoqc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260227105022-gsszoqc","updated":"20260227105930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 模型创作背景"}]},{"ID":"20260227105042-7pyp1xq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227105042-7pyp1xq","updated":"20260227105928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260203094519-qxx8y9q","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"论文存在一个非常严重的问题，该问题十分严重的拖慢了模型的运行速度。"}]},{"ID":"20260227105357-afizdi3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227105357-afizdi3","updated":"20260227105930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260203094519-qxx8y9q","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开创了将卷积神经网络运用到目标检测的第一代，但是他有一个非常严重的缺点-需要的训练与测试的计算资源特别大，耗时久。"}]},{"ID":"20260227105401-ni6i4et","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227105401-ni6i4et","updated":"20260227105423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此该模型就是为了提高其运行速度而生的。"}]},{"ID":"20260227105423-8fxcurn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260227105423-8fxcurn","updated":"20260227105423"}},{"ID":"20260227105132-zxr5osd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260227105132-zxr5osd","updated":"20260227111728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 模型整体架构"}]},{"ID":"20260227105446-gjhwid4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227105446-gjhwid4","updated":"20260227105513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先还是先简单说一说Fast R-CNN的整体架构吧！"}]},{"ID":"20260227105514-c5wiqql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227105514-c5wiqql","updated":"20260227105600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①输入一组图片，以及根据图片绘制好的框框。"}]},{"ID":"20260227105600-gubsl7n","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260227105600-gubsl7n","updated":"20260227105642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260227105603-0zozlw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227105603-0zozlw3","updated":"20260227105641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意这里的框是通过外部的神经网络架构算法生成的算法框。并非是在同一个架构之中的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260227105642-gk4myq1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227105642-gk4myq1","updated":"20260227105730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②先使用一组卷积神经网络模型求出每一张图片的特征图片，然后使用ROI进行框框的划分问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260227110008-dazdq1c","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260227110008-dazdq1c","updated":"20260227110816"},"CalloutType":"TIP","CalloutTitle":"ROI","CalloutIcon":"💡","Children":[{"ID":"20260227110015-tsq4k13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227110015-tsq4k13","updated":"20260227110041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个Fast R-CNN的最大创新我想就是ROI池化层的设计。"}]},{"ID":"20260227110046-cznr3ky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227110046-cznr3ky","updated":"20260227110200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260203094519-qxx8y9q","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"架构之中原本每个输入框的大小并不相同，人们是使用特征变换的操作，将不同大小规格的图片硬生生的搞成相同的规格并将这些输入到全连接层之中。"}]},{"ID":"20260227110140-vd9p0rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227110140-vd9p0rh","updated":"20260227110423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而这里先将每一个框框分成几个小图片("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"7\\times 7_esc_newline_"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")，不论每个小图片的大小几何，直接就进行最大池化的操作，用这个方式让不同输入的尺寸获得相同的输出尺寸。"}]},{"ID":"20260227110429-20uenze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227110429-20uenze","updated":"20260227110816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"height: 25vh;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260227110756-o6ngl9t.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"ROI原理图"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"height: 25vh;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20260227105731-zmtahbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227105731-zmtahbl","updated":"20260227105821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③输出框框最后的分类归属"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"(K+1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以及框框的位置以及回归信息。"}]},{"ID":"20260227110832-x66ywej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227110832-x66ywej","updated":"20260227110935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后经过了这一系列的操作之后变可以进行卷积以及分割的调整操作。\n第二部白女士一个非常大的步骤调整操作，先进行卷积操作、后进行分割操作。"}]},{"ID":"20260227110936-pvidquf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227110936-pvidquf","updated":"20260227111148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若先分割后求得特征向量就像是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260203094519-qxx8y9q","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一样，假设分割了64个框框，那么进入卷积层一个图片要进行64次卷积操作，这个事情消耗的计算量实在是太大了些。因此先卷积后进行特征图的分割就大大降低了计算量，ROI搞出的结构是一个定长的特征向量。"}]},{"ID":"20260227110858-nxt6oif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227110858-nxt6oif","updated":"20260227111244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其次就是损失函数的一个设计问题，之前咱们说到了他的整体输出包括了两个部分：分数、回归"}]},{"ID":"20260227111253-d9a7ygd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260227111253-d9a7ygd","updated":"20260227111254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260227111254-ybmfoq0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260227111254-ybmfoq0","updated":"20260227111254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260227111254-rcxbcdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227111254-rcxbcdz","updated":"20260227111320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分类：判定框框内的物品是否正确，用交叉熵来进行计算。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260227111321-gukzzqc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260227111321-gukzzqc","updated":"20260227111321"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260227111321-57zf4jp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227111321-57zf4jp","updated":"20260227111419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"回归：框框准不准，自己设计了一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"smooth-L_{loss}_esc_newline_"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260227111422-cstsoht","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260227111422-cstsoht","updated":"20260227111704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"Loss = L_{ols}(P,U)+\\lambda[u\\ge 1]L_{loc}(t^{u},U\n) \t"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260227105032-d4wakp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227105032-d4wakp6","updated":"20260227111720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就是整体的损失函数的计算公式。"}]},{"ID":"20260227111723-nb5d39o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260227111723-nb5d39o","updated":"20260227111723"}},{"ID":"20260227104951-ulby72o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260227104951-ulby72o","updated":"20260227112124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3模型框图"}]},{"ID":"20260227111747-oh5if6z","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260227111747-oh5if6z","updated":"20260227112124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"graph LR\n\tpic --\u0026gt; conv\n\tconv --\u0026gt; Feature\n\tFeature --\u0026gt; ROI\n\tROI  --\u0026gt; FC\n\tFC --\u0026gt; 回归参数\n\t回归参数 --\u0026gt; Softmax\n\tSoftmax --\u0026gt; 类别概率P\n\t回归参数 --\u0026gt; regressor\n\tregressor --\u0026gt; 框框偏移量\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260227112124-7eekyot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260227112124-7eekyot","updated":"20260227112124"}}]}